{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2016-05", "window": 2, "start_date": 1462665600, "end_date": 1463356799, "month_true_total": 1074, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:54:25 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "23011206", "author": {"steamid": "76561198136076377", "personaname": "Buy Me Knife Pls", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/_pendah/", "num_games_owned": 79, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 74943, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3464, "last_played": 1781919702, "avatar": "b3994ab1ee84799b1f499d24ea57171ae2c12550"}, "language": "english", "review": "Space Ninjas\nNinjas in Space\nSpace with Ninjas \nNinjas with Space \n10/Space would ninja again", "timestamp_created": 1463356525, "timestamp_updated": 1463356525, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "23011085", "author": {"steamid": "76561198046109908", "personaname": "Goldfossil", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/goldfossil/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 22595, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2981, "last_played": 1649190836, "avatar": "99146a378bca8702017550347b8167b0147dc201"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm not really one for online games with player interaction, but this is super fun. You don't have to interact withanyone to actually play, and there are rad character designs and robo ninjas.\n\nTenno skoom!", "timestamp_created": 1463356049, "timestamp_updated": 1463356049, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "23010711", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025819260", "personaname": "WinterWerewolf", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/winterwerewolf/", "num_games_owned": 508, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 57079, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 38477, "last_played": 1730146826, "avatar": "7f1904f1e811efef68eadc3f8af1e146d6d6c169"}, "language": "english", "review": "EDIT: Recently I started experiencing random disconnections during missions that were causing host migrations - those disconnections failed me some important missions. I did not receive any rewards for them. I do not experience this issue in any other game I play. So until the problem is resolved I would not recommend to play the game although my Pros and Cons are still valid.\n\nI play this game for about a year now. Over 600 hours spent killing enemies and goofing around.\n\n[h1]Pros:[/h1]\n- [b]Ninjas in space![/b]\n- Huge selection of Warframes and weapons\n- Customization\n- Fair business model\n- Nice movement system\n- You can play the game without spending a dime and still have fun\n- New story missions are great\n\n[h1]Cons:[/h1]\n- Grindy...\n- You can customize your character without spending real money only to a certain degree - if you want more you need to have Platinum (in-game currency that can be aquired be spending money or selling prime parts and mods to other players)\n- Repetitive\n- RNG...", "timestamp_created": 1463354190, "timestamp_updated": 1587423189, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"